<para><verbatim>embed:rst 
Tries to accept ``token`` as a completed token :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;` :raw-html:`&lt;br /&gt;`

If accepted, appends the corresponding :cpp:class:`Token` to ``result`` and resets the `DFA`_
</verbatim></para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>token</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The candidate token text accumulated so far </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>stateId</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The id of the <computeroutput>DFA</computeroutput>_ state currently reached after consuming <computeroutput>token</computeroutput> </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>isAccept</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Whether <computeroutput>stateId</computeroutput> is an accepting state </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>result</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The vector to append the accepted :cpp:class:<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_g_remap_core_1_1_token" kindref="compound">Token</ref></computeroutput> to, if accepted </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>lineNo</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The line number <computeroutput>token</computeroutput> belongs to </para>
